title: The Party Press
card-image: img/cards/media.svg
subtitle: [? if player_party = 'menshevik' and dix < 34 : Rabochaya Gazeta ?][? if player_party = 'menshevik' and dix >= 34 : Vsegda Vpered ?][? if player_party = 'sr' : Delo Naroda ?][? if player_party = 'lsr' : Znamya Truda ?]
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer = 3

[? if legality <= 1 : The censors read every line, and the print shop has been raided twice. ?][? if legality > 1 : The party press is the voice of the party. ?] What is the main theme?

- @defence: Defence of the revolution.
- @peace: Peace without annexations.
- @bolsheviks: Against the Bolsheviks.
- @assembly: The Constituent Assembly and the land.
- @soviets: Defence of soviet democracy.
- @land: Land and Freedom: the land to those who work it.
- @easy_discard

@defence
view-if: at_war = 1
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {middle: 3, soldiers: 2, workers: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 2, 0);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 2);
!}

The paper made the case that the revolution must be defended against the Kaiser first, and quarrel about the rest later.

@peace
view-if: at_war = 1
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {soldiers: 4, workers: 3});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 3, -2);
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', -1, 3);
!}

The paper called for a general democratic peace, and for the socialists of Europe to meet at Stockholm.

@bolsheviks
view-if: player_party != 'lsr'
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 2, middle: 2});
RO.add(Q, {bolshevik: -3, rel_bol: -4, rel_lsr: -1});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 3);
!}

A series of articles took apart the Bolshevik programme point by point. It was convincing to those who were already convinced.

@assembly
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 3, middle: 2, nations: 1});
RO.add(Q, {rel_ally: 2, land_pressure: -1});
!}

The Constituent Assembly will settle the land question, the form of the state and the war. The paper insisted that nothing should be settled before it.

@land
view-if: player_party = 'sr' or player_party = 'lsr'
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 6, soldiers: 2});
RO.add(Q, {land_pressure: -1, rel_kad: -1});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -2);
!}

The paper printed the land programme in plain words, with a cartoon of a landlord's estate carved into plots. It is read aloud in the villages by the one literate man.

@soviets
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 2, railway: 2, soldiers: 1});
RO.add(Q, {soviet_democracy: 3, repression: -1});
!}

We wrote about the soviets as the foundation of Russian democracy, and warned that a one-party soviet would no longer be a soviet.
